RevolaOS
Copyright (C) 2026 The RevolaOS Authors. GPL-3.0-only.
The authors are the contributors recorded in each repository's git history.

Every package links the eApp SDK runtime (eapp-sdk/runtime), which is
adapted from the RepriseOS game SDK (https://github.com/lgreitis/osos-lab,
game-sdk/ at 8fc840d) by lgreitis. GPL-3.0-only.

Files that carry an "Adapted from", "Ported from" or copyright header keep
that header.

Third-party work included or built upon:

- Rockbox (https://github.com/Rockbox/rockbox): the 2048 game and its tile
  artwork by Franklin Wei, the high score table by Linus Nielsen Feltzing,
  the Dice app by Brandon Low. GPL-2.0-or-later.
- Khronos OpenGL ES 1.1 and KHR platform headers
  (https://github.com/KhronosGroup/OpenGL-Registry,
  https://github.com/KhronosGroup/EGL-Registry): the GL headers of the SDK
  runtime linked into every package. MIT and Apache-2.0.

Apple firmware is never included. Builds read it from the user's own IPSW.
